<title>USA: New York physical copper market - May 15.</title>
<headline>New York physical copper market - May 15.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Based on COMEX settlement prices, merchant copper cathodes for May shipment were quoted at a nominal 119.75 to 120.00 cents a lb.</p>
<p>Dealers quoted No.2 scrap copper at a nominal 96.00 cents, up 1.00 cent from May 14th.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
